===

title: Garp_Gift_Hunt_bad_gift
location: town
---

Owner: Gold Roger? Do I ever! I have just the ticket!
The owner walks over to the stall's far wall, where several framed pictures sit. He looks through a couple items before pulling one out and placing it on an easel for you to peruse.
This seems to be a large version of one of the most famous photographs there is, and you recognize it immediately. Gold Roger kneels on a platform, moments before his impending execution, grinning widely as he stares into the visual den den mushi. The intensity of his gaze is palpable, and you feel like he's looking straight at you.
The sight sends shivers down your spine. Garp's history with this man has always fascinated you. Even now, you doubt that you have the whole story, but it's clear that they've impacted each other in some pretty meaningful ways.
You turn to the stall owner, who's giving you a hopeful look.
-> I'll take this one!
    <<jump Garp_Gift_Hunt_gift_wrapup>>
-> [If PC has not done ::good_gift] I think I'd like to keep looking. //HOW DO??
