===

title: Garp_Gift_Hunt_gift_wrapup
location: town
---

Owner: Yes, yes! Right away!
The owner wraps up your purchase and brings out a sturdy box for you to carry it in. He gives you the price and you pay him, watching his eyes light up as he counts the berri.
Owner: Thank you for your purchase!
{$name}: Happy holidays!
You walk away from the stall with a spring in your step, clutching your gift close to your chest. You'd given it careful thought, and you hope that your feelings will get across to Garp. Smiling, you head back to your room.
You can't wait for New Year's.
===
